      "evidence": "jwt.verify(token, JWT_SECRET)",
      "llm_reasoning": "The verify function throws an exception on invalid tokens, which can crash the process if not wrapped in a try-catch block.",
      "suggested_fix": "Wrap jwt.verify in a try-catch block or handle the callback error to prevent unhandled exceptions."
